{
  "name": "CRM Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · CRM Sync\nWrites every qualified lead to HubSpot and runs the action for its category.\n\n- **Is AI Spam?** → spam goes only to the **Spam log**, never to the CRM\n- **Search + Upsert Contact**: one contact per email, no duplicates\n- **Is New Contact?** → an existing contact gets a *Repeat inquiry* note (HubSpot API), no new deal\n- **Route by Category**:\n  - hot → deal in *Qualified To Buy* + Telegram alert + Gmail reply draft\n  - warm → follow-up task in 2 days (HubSpot API) + Gmail reply draft\n  - cold → contact only\n  - unexpected → Telegram review alert\n- Every lead ends in the **Leads log** (Google Sheets)\n\n**Setup:** HubSpot Service Key and 6 custom contact properties (see README), Telegram chat ID, HubSpot portal ID in the links, your spreadsheet.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1300
      },
